# 统一换行符：仓库内一律存 LF，检出时按平台处理（消除 CRLF 警告）
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须保留 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制（不要做换行转换）
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.whl binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary

# 让 GitHub 正确识别语言构成
*.py linguist-language=Python
